@Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5007

# Bu dosya VS Code "REST Client" eklentisiyle kullanilmak icin yazildi
# (her ### blogunun ustunde beliren "Send Request" linkine tiklayin - Scalar'da
# elle JSON doldurmaya gerek kalmaz). "login" istegi adlandirilmis (# @name login);
# altindaki tum istekler {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}} ile o token'i
# otomatik okur - siz token'i elle kopyalamazsiniz, sadece once login'i,
# sonra istediginiz diger istegi calistirin. Rider/IntelliJ HTTP Client
# kullaniyorsaniz bu degisken referansi calismaz; onun yerine
# `> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken) %}` script'i
# login isteginin altina eklemeniz gerekir.

### ============================================================
### AUTH
### ============================================================

### Login - admin token al (asagidaki tum korumali istekler buna dayanir)
# @name login
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "Admin!Dev123"
}

### Refresh token - suresi dolan access token'i yenile
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### ============================================================
### SYNC - mobil/web okuyucu ucu, TAMAMI ANONIM (token GONDERMEYIN)
### ============================================================

### Sync - manifest (versiyon + checksum, kucuk/ucuz)
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sync/manifest?bookId=1
Accept: application/json

### Sync - snapshot (ilk kurulum, tam paket)
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sync/snapshot?bookId=1
Accept: application/json

### Sync - changes (delta, fromVersion=0 = "her seyi ver")
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sync/changes?bookId=1&fromVersion=0
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### BOOKS (admin - token gerekir)
### ============================================================

### Books - tum kitaplari listele
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Books - id ile getir
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Books - olmayan id (404 beklenir)
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Books - yeni kitap olustur
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Kitabi",
  "slug": "test-kitabi",
  "description": "deneme",
  "languageCode": "tr"
}

### Books - gecersiz veri (400 + validation hatasi beklenir)
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "slug": "GECERSIZ SLUG!!",
  "languageCode": "tr"
}

### Books - guncelle
PUT {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Kitabi Guncellendi",
  "slug": "test-kitabi-v2",
  "description": "guncellenmis aciklama",
  "languageCode": "tr"
}

### Books - sil (204 beklenir, soft delete)
DELETE {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ============================================================
### MODULES (admin - Faz 5) - gercek book id=1 uzerinden
### ============================================================

### Modules - book 1'in modullerini sayfali listele
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/1/modules?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Modules - id ile getir (gercek id: 2 = "Olay Yonetimi")
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/1/modules/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Modules - yeni modul olustur (DisplayOrder otomatik atanir, gondermeyin)
# @name createModule
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/1/modules
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Modulu",
  "description": "REST Client ile olusturulan deneme modulu",
  "isPublished": false
}

### Modules - az once olusturulani guncelle
PUT {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/1/modules/{{createModule.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Modulu (guncellendi)",
  "description": "guncellenmis aciklama",
  "isPublished": false
}

### Modules - sirala (tum kardes id'ler dahil olmali, eksik/fazla -> Validation hatasi)
PUT {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/1/modules/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderedIds": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 10, 11]
}

### Modules - az once olusturulani sil (204 beklenir)
DELETE {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/1/modules/{{createModule.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ============================================================
### CONTENTS (admin - Faz 5) - gercek module id=2 uzerinden
### ============================================================

### Contents - module 2'nin icerigini sayfali listele
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/modules/2/contents?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Contents - id ile getir (gercek id: 2 = "Sinyaller ve Uyarilar")
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/modules/2/contents/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Contents - yeni content olustur
# @name createContent
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/modules/2/contents
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Konusu",
  "summary": "REST Client ile olusturulan deneme konusu",
  "isPublished": false,
  "variantGroupKey": null,
  "variantLabel": null
}

### Contents - az once olusturulani guncelle
PUT {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/modules/2/contents/{{createContent.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Konusu (guncellendi)",
  "summary": "guncellenmis ozet",
  "isPublished": false,
  "variantGroupKey": null,
  "variantLabel": null
}

### Contents - sirala
PUT {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/modules/2/contents/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderedIds": [2, 3, 4]
}

### Contents - az once olusturulani sil (204 beklenir)
DELETE {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/modules/2/contents/{{createContent.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ============================================================
### CONTENT BLOCKS (admin - Faz 5) - gercek content id=2 uzerinden
### ContentBlockType: Text=1, Image=2, Video=3, Animation=4, Warning=5, Table=6
### ============================================================

### ContentBlocks - content 2'nin bloklarini sayfali listele
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contents/2/blocks?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ContentBlocks - id ile getir (gercek id: 16, Type=1 Text)
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contents/2/blocks/16
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ContentBlocks - yeni Text blogu olustur
# @name createBlock
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contents/2/blocks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 1,
  "text": "REST Client ile olusturulan deneme metin blogu.",
  "dataJson": null,
  "mediaId": null
}

### ContentBlocks - yeni Warning blogu ornegi (dataJson = severity)
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contents/2/blocks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 5,
  "text": "Deneme uyari metni.",
  "dataJson": "{\"severity\":\"high\"}",
  "mediaId": null
}

### ContentBlocks - yeni Table blogu ornegi (dataJson = headers/rows)
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contents/2/blocks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 6,
  "text": null,
  "dataJson": "{\"headers\":[\"Sutun 1\",\"Sutun 2\"],\"rows\":[[\"deger 1\",\"deger 2\"]]}",
  "mediaId": null
}

### ContentBlocks - az once olusturulan Text blogunu guncelle
PUT {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contents/2/blocks/{{createBlock.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 1,
  "text": "guncellenmis metin.",
  "dataJson": null,
  "mediaId": null
}

### ContentBlocks - sirala
PUT {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contents/2/blocks/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderedIds": [15, 16, 17]
}

### ContentBlocks - az once olusturulani sil (204 beklenir)
DELETE {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contents/2/blocks/{{createBlock.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ============================================================
### MEDIA (admin - Faz 6)
### ============================================================

### Media - dosya yukle (multipart)
# NOT: bu istegi calistirmadan once "< ./test-image.png" satirini kendi
# makinenizde gercekten var olan bir resmin yoluna cevirin (orn.
# "< C:/Users/erena/Pictures/ornek.png") - REST Client o dosyayi okuyup
# multipart/form-data govdesine gomer, siz elle byte kopyalamazsiniz.
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/media
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BOUNDARY

------BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-image.png
------BOUNDARY--


### Media - id ile getir (gercek bir medya id'si icin manifest yanitindaki "id" degerlerine bakin)
GET {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/media/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### PUBLISHING (sadece Admin rolu)
### ============================================================

### Publish - book 1'i yeni bir versiyon olarak yayinla
POST {{Isbak_SAR_Guide.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/books/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
